        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第二招，请用独立赚钱的眼光看职场</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #000;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #000;\n    padding: 40px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 22px 20px 26px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    color: #00e5d0;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 9px 6px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  ul.main {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 26px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  ul.main > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 34px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #000;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  ul.main > li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #ffff2e;\n  }\n  .note {\n    background: #d9f7f2;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    padding: 14px 16px 16px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .note ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .note li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .note li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 4px;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .note .sub {\n    padding-left: 26px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 34px;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n  }\n  .footer .fw {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 46px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .tri {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    border-top: 23px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 23px solid transparent;\n    border-left: 46px solid #22c7bb;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title-bar\">第二招，请用独立赚钱的眼光看职场</div>\n\n    <ul class=\"main\">\n      <li>早在二三十年前，郑渊洁就说过：<span class=\"hl\">所谓铁饭碗，不是说你一个饭碗你吃一辈子，而是说你那里都有饭碗。</span></li>\n      <li>经历过口罩事件，见证过太多老板兴衰，百万年薪朋友意志消沉，明确了我一件事，打工不安全。下面有两招，各位自取：</li>\n      <li>1、仔细分析有没有同事，是如何利用公司资源，帮自己形成除了工资以外收入的，你能不能做同样的事情？（身边有，最好学）</li>\n      <li>2、去研究赚钱这件事：工作认真做的同时，利用业余时间，去研究独立赚钱项目，<span class=\"hl\">去做，真的去尝试做，而不是浅尝辄止，走马观花。</span></li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"note\">\n      <ul>\n        <li>真心不建议裸辞，不管什么年龄。原因是人对稳定性要求很高，有工作，会稳定很多，反而容易出结果，要不就要硬扛</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"sub\">（以前我就不懂这个。。。哎，辛酸泪）</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"fw\">下期预告（现在手头上尝试的项目）</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n        <div class=\"tri\"></div>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
